    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Time to Grind? Rule Like a Dominus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominus Automa</i> is a next-gen autogrinder and a fully online adventure designed for ex-hardcore players who still crave epic battles\u2014but can\u2019t commit hours a day. Step into a low-poly, top-down fantasy world where <strong>your hero fights, gathers, crafts, and grows - even while you\u2019re offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into <strong>solo progression, guild raids, PvP arenas, or full party synergy</strong>, <i>Dominus Automa</i> gives you total control through smart systems and automation. Configure your hero\u2019s behavior, set up combat presets, or issue real-time <strong>voice commands</strong> when you're online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Progression</strong> \u2013 Your hero keeps training, fighting, and gathering while you're away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Trinity System</strong> \u2013 Classic Tank, Healer, DPS roles for deep tactical play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Commands</strong> \u2013 Direct your character hands-free in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Automation</strong> \u2013 Configure how your character behaves in various situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Group Play</strong> \u2013 Tackle dungeons alone or join friends and guildmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Climb the ranks or take on massive challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your legacy with smart economy mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly 3D Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, modern art style inspired by classics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commuting, working, or just chilling, your hero keeps fighting. Your world keeps moving. <br>Take command. <strong>Become the Dominus.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Time to Grind? Rule Like a Dominus.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dominus Automa</i> is a next-gen autogrinder and a fully online adventure designed for ex-hardcore players who still crave epic battles\u2014but can\u2019t commit hours a day. Step into a low-poly, top-down fantasy world where <strong>your hero fights, gathers, crafts, and grows - even while you\u2019re offline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're into <strong>solo progression, guild raids, PvP arenas, or full party synergy</strong>, <i>Dominus Automa</i> gives you total control through smart systems and automation. Configure your hero\u2019s behavior, set up combat presets, or issue real-time <strong>voice commands</strong> when you're online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline Progression</strong> \u2013 Your hero keeps training, fighting, and gathering while you're away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Trinity System</strong> \u2013 Classic Tank, Healer, DPS roles for deep tactical play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Commands</strong> \u2013 Direct your character hands-free in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Automation</strong> \u2013 Configure how your character behaves in various situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Group Play</strong> \u2013 Tackle dungeons alone or join friends and guildmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP &amp; Raids</strong> \u2013 Climb the ranks or take on massive challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your legacy with smart economy mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Poly 3D Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A clean, modern art style inspired by classics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're commuting, working, or just chilling, your hero keeps fighting. Your world keeps moving. <br>Take command. <strong>Become the Dominus.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Dominus is a next-gen Autogrinder. Configure your hero combat and actions, send it to open world and close your device. Persistent multiplayer experience set in a world where heroes grind autonomously for you 24/7. Craft, grind, quest in party and guilds. Command your hero from your phone anywhere!",
